ricepilot doctor: 1 problem. nothing was changed; the commands are for you to run.

PROBLEM 1 of 1: <HOME>/.config/foot
  was replaced by a link that only looks like ricepilot's.
  rule: SAFETY.md, the ownership predicate (fact 3: its (dev, ino) must match the ledger)

